  "body": "PR #2819 adds the undoable `InsertText` command and the MCP tool `insert_text`.\nThe script verb and the MCP skill row are still missing.\nThe latest review requires a tracked follow-up for these items.\n\nAdd these items:\n\n- Add `cam.insertText` in `crates/app/src/script/`. Use the existing `InsertText` command. Follow the `cam.importDxf` pattern.\n- Add the `insert_text` row in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`. State its inputs and refusal behavior.\n- Add tests for the script verb, its input checks, and undo behavior.\n\nDone means: `cam.insertText` calls the existing undoable command, its tests pass, and the MCP skill lists `insert_text`.\n\nScope: expose the existing command. Do not change the geometry algorithm or posted G-code.\n\neffort:medium - This work adds a script verb for an existing command and a skill row. It follows an existing pattern.\n\nDecision: Track both missing items in one follow-up, as the review requests. Defer their implementation from PR #2819.\n\nRefs #2679 and PR #2819.\n",
